# Challenges

Some common challenges include:

* Shadow IT
* Rapid cloud adoption
* Forgotten internet-facing assets
* Third-party infrastructure
* Continuously changing environments
* False positives during asset discovery

---

# Best Practices

* Investigate only publicly available information.
* Maintain an up-to-date asset inventory.
* Continuously monitor internet-facing assets.
* Verify findings using multiple trusted sources.
* Respect ethical and legal boundaries.
* Focus on improving visibility rather than exploitation.

